<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>2027 제64회 N시생 전용관</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:#191f28;font-family:"Pretendard","Apple SD Gothic Neo",Arial,sans-serif;word-break:keep-all}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font:inherit}
.inner{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:0 auto}
.section{padding:110px 0}
.section.gray{background:#f6f7f9}
.section.dark{background:#151922;color:#fff}
.section-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:54px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#6264eb}
.section-head h2{margin:0;font-size:42px;line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:-1.8px}
.section-head h2 strong{color:#8f91ff}
.section-head p{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.75;color:#6b7280}
.dark .section-head p{color:#aeb5c2}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:54px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;transition:.2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-primary{background:#6768ed;color:#fff}
.btn-white{background:#fff;color:#191f28}

/* HERO */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:125px 0 120px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%,rgba(109,94,252,.24),transparent 32%),radial-gradient(circle at 15% 75%,rgba(75,136,255,.16),transparent 28%),linear-gradient(135deg,#111522 0%,#1c2131 100%);color:#fff}
.hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:520px;height:520px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-radius:50%;right:-150px;top:-180px}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:850px}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:100px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.hero h1{margin:28px 0 22px;font-size:62px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-3px}
.hero h1 strong{color:#9697ff}
.hero-desc{margin:0;font-size:21px;line-height:1.72;color:#c9ced8}
.hero-date{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:30px;font-size:15px;color:#aeb5c2}
.hero-date strong{color:#fff}
.hero-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:38px}

/* WHY */
.why-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.why-card{min-height:230px;padding:34px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:18px;background:#fff}
.why-num{margin-bottom:28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#7778ec}
.why-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.7px}
.why-card p{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#6b7280}

/* VOICE */
.survey-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:22px}
.survey-data{padding:46px;border-radius:22px;background:#202432;color:#fff}
.survey-data .small{margin-bottom:28px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#9c9dff}
.survey-data h3{margin:0 0 30px;font-size:29px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-1px}
.survey-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);font-size:17px;color:#cfd4dc}
.survey-row strong{font-size:42px;line-height:1;color:#fff}
.survey-row.highlight strong{color:#9c9dff}
.survey-note{margin-top:20px;font-size:12px;color:#8f96a4}
.voice-box{padding:34px;border:1px solid #e4e7ec;border-radius:22px;background:#fff}
.voice-label{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:16px;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:100px;background:#efefff;color:#6264eb;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.voice-item{padding:18px 20px;border-radius:13px;background:#f7f8fa;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#343a46}
.voice-item+.voice-item{margin-top:10px}
.survey-conclusion{margin-top:32px;padding:28px;border-radius:16px;background:#ebeaff;text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.55;color:#3435a8}

/* ROUTE */
.track-switch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:28px}
.track-title{padding:26px 30px;border-radius:18px;background:#1f2431;color:#fff}
.track-title.secondary{background:#6264eb}
.track-title span{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;opacity:.75}
.track-title h3{margin:7px 0 0;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.8px}
.track-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.track-card{padding:28px;border:1px solid #e2e5eb;border-radius:18px;background:#fff}
.track-card .type{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0f1ff;color:#5b5ddd;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.track-card h4{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.track-card p{margin:0;color:#6b7280;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7}
.track-card .go{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #eceef2;font-size:14px;color:#8a8f9c}
.track-card .go strong{display:block;margin-top:5px;color:#3f41bd;font-size:16px}
.track-block+.track-block{margin-top:44px}

/* VERIFY */
.verify-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.verify-box{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);border-radius:22px;background:#202432}
.verify-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;padding:34px 34px 28px}
.verify-top .label{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:10px;color:#9c9dff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.verify-top h3{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.8px}
.coupon-total{text-align:right}
.coupon-total span{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#aeb5c2}
.coupon-total strong{font-size:42px;color:#9c9dff}
.coupon-list{padding:0 34px 34px}
.coupon-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr auto;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
.coupon-item .count{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:38px;border-radius:8px;background:#6768ed;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#fff}
.coupon-item h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px}
.coupon-item p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#9fa6b3}
.coupon-item strong{font-size:16px;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap}
.coupon-note{margin-top:26px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(150,151,255,.11);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#cbd0da;text-align:center}

/* PROCESS */
.process-title{margin:70px 0 28px;text-align:center;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.8px}
.process-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.process-card{position:relative;padding:28px;border-radius:18px;background:#fff;color:#191f28;min-height:190px}
.process-card .step{display:block;margin-bottom:18px;color:#6768ed;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}
.process-card h4{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:20px}
.process-card p{margin:0;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.sample-wrap{position:relative;display:inline-block;margin-top:16px}
.sample-btn{border:0;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f1ff;color:#5557d7;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
.sample-pop{display:none;position:absolute;z-index:30;left:0;top:48px;width:330px;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.25);color:#191f28}
.sample-wrap:hover .sample-pop,.sample-wrap.open .sample-pop{display:block}
.sample-doc{border:1px solid #d9dde5;border-radius:8px;padding:17px;background:#fff}
.sample-doc .doc-title{text-align:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:15px}
.simple-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px 1fr;border-top:1px solid #eceef2;padding:9px 0;font-size:13px}
.simple-row:first-of-type{border-top:0}
.simple-row span{color:#8a8f9c}
.simple-check{margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f6f7f9;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#5c6370}
.verify-target{margin-top:30px;padding:22px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#b8bec9}
.verify-target strong{color:#fff}
.verify-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:34px}

/* PRODUCTS */
.product-tabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.product-tabs a{padding:9px 14px;border-radius:100px;background:#f0f1f4;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;color:#5c6370}
.product-tabs a:hover{background:#e5e6ff;color:#4e50c6}
.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.product-card{position:relative;padding:36px;border:1px solid #e1e4ea;border-radius:22px;background:#fff}
.product-card.pick{border-top:5px solid #6768ed}
.product-card.pass{border-top:5px solid #282d39}
.product-tag{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:100px;background:#efefff;color:#5759d8;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}
.product-card.pass .product-tag{background:#eef0f3;color:#3e4653}
.product-card h3{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:29px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-1px}
.product-target{min-height:52px;margin:0 0 25px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#6b7280}
.recommend-box{padding:19px;border-radius:13px;background:#f7f8fa}
.recommend-title{margin-bottom:11px;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#646a75}
.recommend-item{position:relative;padding-left:19px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#4e5561}
.recommend-item:before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:#696bea;font-weight:900}
.product-info{margin-top:23px;border-top:1px solid #eceef1}
.product-info-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef1;font-size:14px}
.product-info-row span{color:#8a8f9c}
.product-info-row strong{text-align:right;color:#343a46}
.price-wrap{margin-top:26px}
.price-normal{text-decoration:line-through;color:#9da3ad;font-size:14px}
.price-discount{margin-top:8px;font-size:31px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.2px}
.price-discount .rate{display:inline-flex;margin-right:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:7px;background:#6768ed;color:#fff;font-size:14px;vertical-align:5px}
.book-benefit{margin-top:19px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff7e9;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#69583c}
.book-benefit strong{color:#c36d00}
.product-guide{margin-top:30px;padding:23px;border-radius:14px;background:#f4f4ff;text-align:center;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#565cc0}
.product-guide strong{font-size:16px}

/* 2ND GS BENEFITS */
.gs-wrap{margin-top:62px;padding:38px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e2330,#2a3040);color:#fff}
.gs-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:24px}
.gs-head .mini{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#9c9dff}
.gs-head h3{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:30px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-1px}
.gs-head p{margin:0;max-width:460px;color:#b8bec9;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;text-align:right}
.gs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.gs-card{padding:24px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
.gs-card .badge{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:13px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:6px;background:#6b6dec;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.gs-card h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:21px}
.gs-card p{margin:0;color:#b6bdc8;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.gs-card .period{margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);font-size:13px;color:#e2e5eb}

/* COMING */
.coming-content{text-align:center;padding:60px 30px;border:1px dashed #cfd3da;border-radius:22px;background:#fff}
.coming-content h2{margin:0;font-size:38px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-1.4px}
.coming-content p{margin:18px 0 0;color:#6b7280;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}
.coming-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:26px;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:100px;background:#f0f1ff;color:#5557d7;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}
.coming-badge strong{font-size:12px}

/* NOTICE */
.notice{padding:72px 0;background:#f0f2f5}
.notice h3{margin:0 0 24px;font-size:24px}
.notice ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}
.notice li{margin:9px 0;color:#666d78;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}
.notice li strong{color:#333946}

/* FLOAT */
.float-nav{position:fixed;z-index:50;right:24px;bottom:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.float-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:128px;height:46px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 7px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.16);font-size:13px;font-weight:900}
.float-nav .verify{background:#6768ed;color:#fff}
.float-nav .products{background:#fff;color:#252a34}

@media(max-width:900px){
.section{padding:82px 0}.section-head h2{font-size:34px}.hero{padding:95px 0 90px}.hero h1{font-size:47px}.hero-desc{font-size:18px}
.why-grid,.track-grid,.process-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.survey-wrap,.verify-summary,.product-grid,.gs-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.track-switch{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gs-head{display:block}.gs-head p{text-align:left;margin-top:12px}.coupon-item{grid-template-columns:55px 1fr}.coupon-item>strong{grid-column:2}.product-target{min-height:auto}.sample-pop{left:auto;right:0}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
.inner{width:min(100% - 28px,1180px)}.section{padding:68px 0}.section-head{margin-bottom:38px}.section-head h2{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-1.2px}.section-head p{font-size:15px}.hero{padding:78px 0 75px}.hero h1{font-size:39px;letter-spacing:-2px}.hero-desc{font-size:16px}.hero-btns{flex-direction:column}.hero-date{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.why-card,.survey-data,.voice-box,.product-card{padding:26px}.survey-row strong{font-size:35px}.verify-top{padding:27px 24px 23px}.coupon-list{padding:0 24px 26px}.coupon-item{grid-template-columns:50px 1fr}.process-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gs-wrap{padding:26px 22px}.coming-content{padding:45px 20px}.coming-content h2{font-size:30px}.float-nav{right:14px;bottom:14px}.float-nav a{min-width:110px}.sample-pop{width:290px;right:-20px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-badge">2027 제64회 N시생 전용관</span>
      <h1>다시 시작하는 공부는<br><strong>처음과 달라야 하니까.</strong></h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">이미 공부한 것까지 처음부터 다시 듣지 마세요.<br>1차든 2차든, 지금 내게 필요한 과목과 학습 단계부터 선택하는<br>메가변리사 N시생 전용관</p>
      <div class="hero-date"><span>1차 판매기간</span><strong>2026.10.07 ~ 2026.11.04</strong></div>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="#verify" class="btn btn-primary">N시생 인증하고 혜택받기</a>
        <a href="#products" class="btn btn-white">N시생 전용 상품 보기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FOR N-TH EXAMINEE</span>
      <h2>처음부터 다시가 아니라,<br>필요한 곳부터 다시.</h2>
      <p>시험을 한 번 이상 준비해 본 수험생이라면<br>필요한 공부의 범위도, 시작해야 할 지점도 다릅니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-num">01</div><h3>필요한 이론만 다시</h3><p>전과목을 처음부터 다시 수강하기보다 기억이 흐려진 과목과 필요한 이론만 골라 보완합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-num">02</div><h3>지금 단계부터 집중</h3><p>이론 학습 경험이 있다면 객관식, 2차 이론, GS처럼 현재 필요한 단계부터 바로 시작합니다.</p></div>
      <div class="why-card"><div class="why-num">03</div><h3>필요한 강좌만 추가</h3><p>PASS까지 필요하지 않다면 N시생 전용 단강좌 할인쿠폰으로 필요한 강좌만 추가할 수 있습니다.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SURVEY -->
<section class="section gray">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">N시생 VOICE</span>
      <h2>다시 시작할 때 원하는 공부는<br>처음과 달랐습니다.</h2>
      <p>실제 수강생의 선택과 의견을 바탕으로<br>N시생에게 필요한 학습 방식을 다시 생각했습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="survey-wrap">
      <div class="survey-data">
        <div class="small">1차 수험생 ALL PASS 이용 비중</div>
        <h3>초시생과 재시생의<br>상품 선택에는 차이가 있었습니다.</h3>
        <div class="survey-row"><span>1차 초시생</span><strong>63%</strong></div>
        <div class="survey-row highlight"><span>1차 재시생</span><strong>40%</strong></div>
        <div class="survey-note">* 메가변리사 유료회원 설문조사 기준</div>
      </div>
      <div class="voice-box">
        <span class="voice-label">실제 N시생 의견</span>
        <div class="voice-item">“재시라서 강의는 1~2개 정도만 필요합니다.”</div>
        <div class="voice-item">“기초 강의까지 들을 필요는 없어서 올패스의 필요성을 못 느꼈습니다.”</div>
        <div class="voice-item">“1차 재시생들을 위한 패키지도 생기면 좋겠습니다.”</div>
        <div class="voice-item">“듣고 싶은 과목과 강의만 선택해서 듣고 싶어서.”</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="survey-conclusion">그래서 N시생 전용관은<br>‘더 많이’가 아니라 ‘필요한 만큼’을 기준으로 만들었습니다.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ROUTE -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">N시생 맞춤 학습 ROUTE</span>
      <h2>지금 준비하는 시험과<br>필요한 단계부터 찾아보세요.</h2>
      <p>1차를 다시 준비하는 경우와 2차를 다시 준비하는 경우,<br>필요한 상품과 혜택을 나누어 구성했습니다.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="track-block">
      <div class="track-title"><span>01 · 1차 N시생</span><h3>1차를 다시 준비한다면</h3></div>
